msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Access preferred connections from system tray. Enter country or server "
"codes, separated by commas, to quickly connect (e.g.: NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."
msgstr ""
"Ẹ lè ní ìráàyèsí sí àwọn àsopọ̀ tí ẹ fẹ́ràn jùlọ láti tẹ́rí ètò. Ẹ tẹ̀ àwọn "
"kóòdù orílẹ̀-èdè tàbí sáfà sínú, tí ẹ fi kọ́mà yà sọ́tọ̀, kí ẹ lè so pọ̀ ní "
"kíákíá (àpẹẹrẹ: NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Active port is {new_port}"
msgstr "Ihò ìtẹ̀bọ̀ tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ ni {new_port}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Allow selected apps to connect without VPN protection."
msgstr "Jẹ́ kí àwọn áàpù tí a yàn lè so pọ̀ láìní ààbò VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Automatically disconnect from the internet if VPN connection is lost."
msgstr "Yóò tú ìsopọ̀ kúrò ní ayélujára nípa àìsọ̀rí tí àsopọ̀ VPN bá sọ́nù."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been disabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"A ti paná Beta Access.\n"
"Ẹ tún áàpù náà bẹ̀rẹ̀ kí àwọn ayípadà lè bá ṣiṣẹ́."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been enabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"A ti fi ààyè gba Beta Access.\n"
"Ẹ tún áàpù náà bẹ̀rẹ̀ kí àwọn ayípadà lè bá ṣiṣẹ́."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Bypass firewalls to connect to P2P servers and devices on your local "
"network. "
msgstr ""
"Ẹ kọjá àwọn ààbò orí kọ̀mpútà kí ẹ lè so pọ̀ mọ́ àwọn sáfà P2P àti àwọn irin"
" iṣẹ́ lórí nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì agbègbè yín. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Captures a specific issue you're facing when using Proton VPN to get help from our customer support team.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: This file is a recording of all your internet activity during the capture session."
msgstr ""
"Ó ń gba ìṣòro pàtàkì kan tí ẹ ń pàdé nígbà lílo Proton VPN, kí ẹ lè gba ìrànlọ́wọ́ láti ọ̀dọ̀ ẹ̀ka àtìlẹ́yìn oníbàárà wa.\n"
"\n"
"Ìkìlọ̀: Fáìlì yìí jẹ́ àkọsílẹ̀ gbogbo ìṣe ayélujára yín nígbà sáà gígba náà."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Connect to Proton VPN using your own domain name servers (DNS)."
msgstr "Ẹ so pọ̀ mọ́ Proton VPN nípa lílo àwọn sáfà orúkọ ojú òpó yín (DNS)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to a Tor server to access hidden services and onion sites using any "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"So pọ̀ mọ́ sáfà Tor kan láti lè ní ìráàyèsí sí àwọn iṣẹ́ àpamọ̀ àti àwọn "
"ojú-ewé ìráàyèsí mọ níwọ̀nba nípa lílo bráósà èyíkéyìí."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to your destination server through a second, maximum security VPN "
"server. Slower, but more private."
msgstr ""
"Ẹ so pọ̀ mọ́ sáfà ìríkàn yín nípasẹ̀ sáfà VPN kejì tí ó ní ààbò gíga. Ó máa "
"ń dínkù nínú yíyára, ṣùgbọ́n ó ní ìkọ̀kọ̀ síwájú."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Copied!"
msgstr "A ti ṣàdàkọ!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Crash reports help us fix bugs, detect firewalls, and avoid VPN blocks.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Ìjábọ̀ àìṣiṣẹ́ ń ran wa lọ́wọ́ láti tún àwọn àṣìṣe ẹ̀rọ ṣe, láti mọ àwọn ààbò orí kọ̀mpútà, àti láti yè ìdènà VPN kúrò.\n"
"\n"
"Àwọn ìṣirò yìí kò ní àdírẹ́sì IP yín, wọn kò sì lè fi ṣe ìdánimọ̀ yín. A kò níí ṣe alábàápín wọn pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹgbẹ́ kẹta nígbàkùgbà."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Customize your connection by deciding which apps are protected by VPN."
msgstr "Ṣètò àsopọ̀ yín fúnra yín nípa dídíyàn àwọn áàpù tí VPN yóò dábò bọ̀."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Disables randomization of the local addresses mapping. This can slightly "
"reduce connection security, but should allow direct connections for online "
"gaming and similar purposes."
msgstr ""
"Ó paná ìyípadà àgbékalẹ̀ àwọn àdírẹ́sì agbègbè. Èyí lè dín ààbò àsopọ̀ kù "
"díẹ̀, ṣùgbọ́n ó yẹ kí ó jẹ́ kí àsopọ̀ tààrà ṣeéṣe fún eré lórí ayélujára àti"
" àwọn ohun mìíràn bẹ́ẹ̀."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Disabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Ó ń pa Beta Access..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Each code can only be used once"
msgstr "A lè lo kóòdù kọ̀ọ̀kan ní ẹ̀ẹ̀kan ṣoṣo."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Enabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Ó ń ṣí Beta Access..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Get early access and help us test new versions of Proton VPN."
msgstr ""
"Ẹ gba ìtètè ráàyèsí kí ẹ sì ran wa lọ́wọ́ láti dánwò àwọn ẹ̀yà tuntun ti "
"Proton VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "If your security key has a button or a gold disc, tap it now."
msgstr "Tí bọtìnnì ààbò yín bá ní bọ́tìnnì tàbí dáìsí wúrà, ẹ fi ọwọ́ tọ́ ọ."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Increase your connection speed by up to 400% with performance enhancing "
"technologies."
msgstr "Ló ìmọ̀-ẹ̀rọ ìdàgbàsókè iṣẹ́ láti pọ̀ sí i ìyára àsopọ̀ yín dé 400%."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Insert the U2F or FIDO key linked to your Proton Account. "
msgstr "Fi bọtìnnì U2F tàbí FIDO tí a so mọ́ Àkántì Proton yín sínú. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to disable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "A kò lè paná Beta Access.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to enable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "A kò lè fi ààyè gba Beta Access.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr ""
"A lè yí olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP padà nígbà tí a bá ti tú ìsopọ̀ VPN nìkan."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch is blocking any outgoing connections."
msgstr "Olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP ń dẹ́kùn gbogbo àsopọ̀ tí ń jáde."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Kill switch selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"A ti paná àyàn olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP nígbà tí VPN ń ṣiṣẹ́. Ẹ tú ìsopọ̀ "
"kí ẹ lè ṣe àwọn àyípadà."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Loading app..."
msgstr "Ó ń gbé áàpù kalẹ̀..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Multiple security keys were found. Tap one to select it."
msgstr "A rí àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ ààbò púpọ̀. Ẹ tẹ̀ ọ̀kan láti yàn án."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only allow internet access when connected to Proton VPN. Advanced kill "
"switch will remain active even when you restart your device."
msgstr ""
"A ó fi ayè sílẹ̀ fún ìráàyèsí sí ayélujára nígbà tí ẹ bá so pọ̀ mọ́ Proton "
"VPN nìkan. Olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP tó síwájú yóò máa ṣiṣẹ́ síbẹ̀ bí ẹ bá "
"tilẹ̀ tún irin iṣẹ́ yín bẹ̀rẹ̀."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only selected apps connect with VPN protection. All other traffic is "
"unprotected."
msgstr ""
"Àwọn áàpù tí a yan nìkan ni ń so pọ̀ pẹ̀lú ààbò VPN. Gbogbo lílọ bíbọ̀ "
"mìíràn kò ní ààbò."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Permanent Kill Switch is blocking any outgoing connections and preventing your IP to be exposed.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to disable Kill Switch?"
msgstr ""
"Olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP títí ń dẹ́kùn gbogbo àsopọ̀ tí ń jáde, ó sì ń dẹ̀kun kí IP yín má fihàn.\n"
"\n"
"Ṣé ẹ fẹ́ paná olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP náà?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Please establish a new VPN connection for changes to take effect."
msgstr "Ẹ ṣe àsopọ̀ VPN tuntun kí àwọn àyípadà lè bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti ṣiṣẹ́."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protect yourself from ads, malware, and trackers on websites and apps."
msgstr ""
"Ẹ dá ara yín bọ̀ láti ọwọ́ àwọn ìpolówó, máálweà, àti àwọn olùtọpa lórí àwọn"
" wẹ́bsáìtì àti àwọn áàpù."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protects your IP address by disconnecting you from the internet if you lose "
"your VPN connection. {learn_more}"
msgstr ""
"Ó ń dáàbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP yín nípa dídì yín kúrò ní ayélujára tí àsopọ̀ VPN "
"yín bá sọ́nù. {learn_more}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protocol can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr "A lè yí protókọ̀lù padà nígbà tí VPN bá ti tú ìsopọ̀."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protocol selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"A ti paná ìyàn pọ́rọ̀tọ́kọ́lù nígbà tí VPN ń ṣiṣẹ́. Ẹ tú ìsopọ̀ kí ẹ lè ṣe "
"àyípadà."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Bí ẹ bá kúrò nínú aplikéṣàn náà, yóò fagi lé àsopọ̀ VPN yín lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́.\n"
"\n"
"Ṣé ẹ fẹ́ tẹ̀síwájú?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will keep the kill switch active, but your current VPN connection will be terminated.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Bí ẹ bá kúrò nínú aplikéṣàn náà, olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP yóò máa bá ti ṣiṣẹ́, àmọ́ àsopọ̀ VPN yín lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yóò wá parun.\n"
"\n"
"Ṣé ẹ fẹ́ tẹ̀síwájú?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Reporting your issue..."
msgstr "Ó ń fi ìṣòro yín ránṣẹ́..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing in..."
msgstr "Ó ń kó wọlé..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection and disable the kill switch.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Bí ẹ bá jáde, yóò fagi lé àsopọ̀ VPN yín lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́, yóò sì paná olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP.\n"
"\n"
"Ṣé ẹ fẹ́ tẹ̀síwájú?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Bí ẹ bá jáde, yóò fagi lé àsopọ̀ VPN yín lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́.\n"
"\n"
"Ṣé ẹ fẹ́ tẹ̀síwájú?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will disable the kill switch, potentially exposing your internet traffic. \n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Bí ẹ bá jáde, yóò paná olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP, èyí tí ó lè há lílọ bíbọ̀ ayélujára yín lẹ́rù. \n"
"\n"
"Ṣé ẹ fẹ́ tẹ̀síwájú?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing out..."
msgstr "Ó ń jáde..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Some required components were not detected on your system. The app may not "
"work as expected."
msgstr ""
"A kò rí àwọn apá kan tí a nílò sí ní etí ọ̀gbìn yín. Áàpù náà lè kì í ṣiṣẹ́ "
"bí a ti ń rò."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Split tunneling enabled. Remember to restart affected apps."
msgstr ""
"A ti fi ààyè gba ìkáàkiri tí a pín. Ẹ rántí láti tún àwọn áàpù tí ọ̀rọ̀ náà "
"kàn bẹ̀rẹ̀."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"These servers give the best performance for BitTorrent and file sharing."
msgstr "Àwọn sáfà yìí ló dára jùlọ fún BitTorrent àti ṣíṣe alábàápín fáìlì."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"This technology allows Proton VPN to provide higher speed and security in "
"difficult-to-reach countries."
msgstr ""
"Ìmọ̀-ẹ̀rọ yìí jẹ́ kí Proton VPN lè pèsè ìyára àti àbò tó ga jù ní àwọn "
"orílẹ̀ èdè tí ó ṣòrò láti dé."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will automatically set your protocol to WireGuard."
msgstr "Èyí yóò fi protókọ́lì yín sí WireGuard nípa àìsọ̀rí."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable NetShield."
msgstr "Èyí yóò paná NetShield."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable custom DNS."
msgstr "Èyí yóò paná DNS àkànṣe."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable kill switch."
msgstr "Èyí yóò paná olùdá ààbò bo àdírẹ́sì IP."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable split tunneling."
msgstr "Èyí yóò paná ìkáàkiri tí a pín náà."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Tunnels IPv6 traffic through the VPN. Can enhance compatibility with IPv6 "
"networks."
msgstr ""
"Ó ń kó lílọ bíbọ̀ IPv6 kọjá láàrín VPN. Ó lè mú ìbámu pọ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn "
"nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì IPv6."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Usage data helps us overcome VPN blocks and improve app performance.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Dátà ìlò ń ràn wá lọ́wọ́ láti bori àwọn ìdènà VPN àti láti jẹ́ kí áàpù ń ṣiṣẹ́ dáadáa.\n"
"\n"
"Àwọn ìṣirò yìí kò ní àdírẹ́sì IP yín, a kò sì leè fi mọ ẹnyín mọ́. A kò ní ṣe alábàápín wọn pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹgbẹ́ kẹta kankan."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "When enabled, the app starts minimized to the tray."
msgstr ""
"Nígbà tí a bá fi ààyè gbà á, áàpù náà máa ń bẹ̀rẹ̀ tí a ti sọ ọ́ di kékeré "
"sí tẹ́rí."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"You will be connected to a server as soon as Proton VPN app starts. Replace "
"it with a country ISO code (e.g.: US for United States), a server (e.g.: "
"NL#42) or Fastest for quick connection. Default value: Off."
msgstr ""
"Wọ́n yóò so yín mọ́ sáfà lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ tí áàpù Proton VPN bá bẹ̀rẹ̀ síṣẹ́. Ẹ "
"rọ́pọ̀ ọ́ pẹ̀lú kóòdù ISO orílẹ̀-èdè (àpẹẹrẹ: US fún Amẹ́ríkà), sáfà kan "
"(àpẹẹrẹ: NL#42) tàbí Fastest fún àsopọ̀ kíákíá. Iye bí ó ti wà: Pa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your feedback helps us improve Proton VPN."
msgstr "Ìfèsí yín ń ràn wa lọ́wọ́ láti mú Proton VPN dàrá sí i."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your issue has been reported"
msgstr "A ti fi ìṣòro yín ránṣẹ́."

